msgid ""
"An application appears here as soon as the advisor has made\n"
"               first contact. The file itself opens at pre-admission, and\n"
"               the institutional registration number is only issued when the\n"
"               registration fees are collected."
msgstr ""
"Une candidature apparaît ici dès que la conseillère a établi le\n"
"               premier contact. Le dossier, lui, s'ouvre à la pré-admission, et\n"
"               le matricule institutionnel n'est émis qu'à l'encaissement des\n"
"               frais d'inscription."

